{"from_address":"Yashwanth <yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com>","to_address":"hretherxinnovations@gmail.com","subject":"Request for Work From Home Due to Family Medical Situation","date":"Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:14:01 +0530","message_id":"<CAGsfBeAR0Wjk_xaMEiCNRzStQVsi0mbckeFQiy9KsjrnkbBPZA@mail.gmail.com>","reply_to":"","return_path":"","received_chain":[],"authentication_results":null,"x_originating_ip":null,"raw_headers":{"MIME-Version":"1.0","Date":"Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:14:01 +0530","Message-ID":"<CAGsfBeAR0Wjk_xaMEiCNRzStQVsi0mbckeFQiy9KsjrnkbBPZA@mail.gmail.com>","Subject":"Request for Work From Home Due to Family Medical Situation","From":"Yashwanth <yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com>","To":"hretherxinnovations@gmail.com","Content-Type":"multipart/alternative; boundary=\"00000000000059fff9065800b04e\""},"body_plain":"Dear Sir/Madam,\n\nI hope you are doing well.\n\nI wanted to inform you that, due to my father's medical condition, I won't\nbe able to continue working from the CHOSS office for the time being. I\nneed to accompany him for frequent hospital visits and unexpected medical\ncheck-ups, making it difficult for me to manage both my family\nresponsibilities and office attendance.\n\nI would like to request permission to work from home temporarily. This\narrangement will allow me to take care of my father while ensuring that I\ncontinue to fulfill all my work responsibilities without any interruption.\n\nI assure you that I will remain fully available during working hours,\nattend all meetings, and complete all assigned tasks on time with the same\nlevel of dedication and commitment.\n\nI kindly request your understanding and approval for this work-from-home\narrangement. Your support during this difficult time would be greatly\nappreciated.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to your positive\nresponse.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\n*Yashwanth Raj D J*\nEtherX Innovations Pvt. Ltd.","body_html":"<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p><p>I hope you are doing well.</p><p>I wanted to inform you that, due to my father&#39;s medical condition, I won&#39;t be able to continue working from the CHOSS office for the time being. I need to accompany him for frequent hospital visits and unexpected medical check-ups, making it difficult for me to manage both my family responsibilities and office attendance.</p><p>I would like to request permission to work from home temporarily. This arrangement will allow me to take care of my father while ensuring that I continue to fulfill all my work responsibilities without any interruption.</p><p>I assure you that I will remain fully available during working hours, attend all meetings, and complete all assigned tasks on time with the same level of dedication and commitment.</p><p>I kindly request your understanding and approval for this work-from-home arrangement. Your support during this difficult time would be greatly appreciated.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to your positive response.</p><p>Yours sincerely,</p><p><strong>Yashwanth Raj D J</strong><br>EtherX Innovations Pvt. Ltd.</p></div>","ocr_text":"","qr_urls":[],"attachments":[],"urls":[],"custody":{"evidence_id":"EV-04A0997E8501","filename":"Request for Work From Home Due to Family Medical Situation.eml","file_size_bytes":2940,"sha256":"96d22e34e07a8d0253cec0356cd10d8daa9de4120a40ecb72278ef900a6dfb54","sha1":"bfd8500d44185ec52455c911b6b29da21d91cd53","md5":"134d9b57a8866ceaf04fb3bd0aff0cd6","ingestion_timestamp_utc":"2026-08-25T13:39:32.737182+00:00","custody_seal":"SEAL-43475F84B1995E18","integrity_verified":true},"blockchain_receipt":{"evidence_hash_sha256":"3888312cb7e5a22babb7b2d5aee5d6893e997ff4687de76888d364790b56e10c","blockchain_network":"Local-Ethereum-Notary","transaction_hash":"0xb76738d6a337a8ae58ca46a9a44098c578f9b9f65ce43613e7a5e7dcecac814b","timestamp_utc":"2026-08-25T13:39:32.741672+00:00","status":"NOTARIZED_ON_LEDGER"},"semantic_matches":[{"email_id":"CAMP-DOM-CAREINSURANCE-COM"